WEBVTT

00:10:59.029 --> 00:11:03.367
It changes. New streams come in,
and that is fantastic.

00:11:03.409 --> 00:11:07.413
And that is one of the big ideas
I want to leave you with last of all.

00:11:08.122 --> 00:11:11.542
Because right now as we speak,

00:11:11.542 --> 00:11:14.128
COVID-19 and the lockdown

00:11:14.128 --> 00:11:18.090
in many ways has been an extraordinary
period of culture shock.

00:11:18.632 --> 00:11:23.345
It's given you all what anthropologists
experience when they go to other cultures.

00:11:23.846 --> 00:11:26.473
The chance to be jolted out
of what was normal

00:11:26.473 --> 00:11:28.767
and to look at your world again.

00:11:28.809 --> 00:11:32.187
To become a stranger
in your own land again.